Peso Gain On Yuan Revaluation \par China's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Move Seen Benefiting Argentina's Farmers \par US Tsy Official: No Big Impact On Tsy Mkt From China Move \par  \par  \par Other Stories: \par  \par Full Text Of China \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Statement On Yuan Change \par RATINGS WATCH: China Upgrade Factored In Revaluation \par China PBOC: Raises Upper Limit For USD, HKD Deposit Rates \par =UPDATE: Hong Kong Still Satisified With Peg System \par China's Yuan Move Unlikely To Hurt Japan Refiners Exports \par S&P:China's Yuan Move Should Lead To Further Econ Reform \par US Stks Outlook: China's Yuan Move Offers Opportunities \par US Cos Likely To Remain Indebted To China Despite Reval \par China's Float Of Yuan Could Increase Tech Part Costs \par WSJ: US Specialist On China Sees Good And Bad In Yuan Move \par BIS: Yuan Move A Welcome Step Towards \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Flexibility \par US Sen Graham: China Move Achieves Much Of What Was Sought \par US Sens Schumer,Graham Suspend Vote On China Tariff Bill \par US Sen: China \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Move A 'Good 1st Step...Baby Step' \par Sen Grassley: China \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Move 'By No Means End Of The Road' \par US Cos May Seen Higher Funding Costs On China Yuan Move \par Retailers Still Have Options After China's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Move \par China \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Float May Level M&A Playing Field In US \par  \par Commentary: \par  \par =POINT OF VIEW: China's Yuan Move To Help Its M&A In U.S. \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 China's modest \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  revaluation might have an outsized impact on Chinese companies' ability to execute takeovers in the U.S. The move might weaken U.S. Congressional and other opposition enough to allow future Chinese company attempts to buy U.S. counterparts to attain a greater degree of economic normalcy.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par =\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FOREX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VIEW: China's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Reform Begins To Crawl \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Reform of China's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  system picked up speed Thursday - it's now moving at a crawl.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 That won't be fast enough a pace to satisfy the harshest U.S. critics of Chinese policy, but it will probably win the Chinese government more time in which to take bigger and stronger strides towards \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  flexibility.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par =BIG PICTURE: China's Yuan Move No Panacea For Deficit \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Chairman Mao is credited with saying the longest journey begins with the first step. On Thursday, the People's Bank of China took the first step on a very long journey when it announced an adjustment to the yuan's exchange rate value.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par =\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FOREX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VIEW: China Move Hits \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Market Where It Hurts \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 For many \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  speculators and investors, China's revaluation of the yuan added a painful punctuation to what has been a problematic time.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par Other Commentary: \par  \par WSJ(7/22) China's Yuan Revaluation May Help Bring Balance \par =GLOBAL YIELD: It's Small, But China Move Packs Punch \par =ECB Watch:China Yuan Move Makes ECB Rate Cut Less Likely \par =AWSJ: Yuan Revaluation Gives China Monetary Flexibility \p