\par\par \b \uc2 Special Summary:China Abandons Yuan Peg For Managed Float  \b0\par\par\uc2 1,407 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Juli 2005\par 03:07\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 China has ended the yuan's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  peg and will allow a managed float against a basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Dow Jones Newswires' coverage can be found by searching on the code M/CNY.  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par China Abandons \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Peg, Revalues Yuan 2% Higher \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 In a long-awaited move, China abandoned its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  peg Thursday and said it would allow the yuan to trade against a basket of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in a so-called managed float regime.  \par \par \uc2 As part of the move, the People's Bank of China revalued the yuan to 8.11 to the dollar, a 2% increase in value compared with closing levels Thursday, before the move was announced. Chinese authorities have kept the yuan trading in a tight band around 8.28 to the dollar over the last decade.  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par China PBOC: Raises Upper Limit For USD, HKD Deposit Rates \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 China's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on Thursday said it was raising the upper limit on U.S. and Hong Kong dollar deposit rates, a move that could help stave off selling of those \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  as the yuan appreciates.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Greenspan: China \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Move `Is A Good First Step' \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 China's decision to revalue its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by about 2% is a welcome first step, Federal Reserve Board Chairman Alan Greenspan said Thursday.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "It is certainly a good first step," Greenspan said in testimony before the Senate Banking Committee. "It is the kind of step you want to make when you have had a decade- long fixed structure."  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par US Tsy Official: No Big Impact On Tsy Mkt From China Move \par US Tsy Official: China Move A 'Glidepath' To Full \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Float>G/TRE \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 China's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  revaluation will not have a "significant impact" on the U.S. Treasury market, a senior U.S. Treasury official said Thursday.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par US Lawmakers Vow To Keep Pushing China On \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Reform \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Several U.S. House Republicans welcomed China's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  policy moves, but warned the changes don't go nearly far enough. They pledged to keep up pressure on China to let its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  float freely.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par ECB Trichet: Chinese Yuan Decision Is Welcome \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  President Jean-Claude Trichet Thursday welcomed China's decision to scrap the yuan's peg to the dollar, and said the move would help to increase global stability.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par Reaction Stories From Around The World \par Japan Hosoda: Would Welcome If China Ups \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Flexibility \par Japan Tanigaki: China Revaluation 'A Starting Point' \par Japan Foreign Min:CNY Change Won't Impact Japan Econ Now \par Japan Takenaka:Yuan Move Desirable For China,Global Econ \par Japan Bank Min Ito: China Move 1st Step Toward \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Reform \par Korea Fin Min:To Monitor \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Mkt, To Fully Respond-Report \par World Governments, Central Banks Hail China Revaluation \par US Officials Welcome Yuan Revaluation As Good First Step \par US Tsy Snow Welcomes China's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Move \par Tsy's Snow: China Move "Important Step" For World Economy \par G7 Fin Mins Welcome China Yuan Move \par UK Brown: China Yuan Revaluation To Aid Stability, Growth \par FOCUS: Euro Policy-Makers, Cos Hail China \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Move \par IMF: China Should Use Full Scope Of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Flexibility \par =UPDATE: Hong Kong Still Satisified With Peg System \par BOJ: Highly Appreciate China's Decision On Yuan \par Japan MOF Watanabe Welcomes Chinese Yuan Revaluation \par Japan Tanigaki: Welcome China's Decision On Yuan-Kyodo \par German BGA: China's Yuan Revaluation Only A First Step \par    -German BGA Group: Further Yuan Revaluation Steps Needed \par Germany's Eichel Welcomes China's Yuan Revaluation \par French Fin Min: Yuan Revaluation In Line With G7 Wishes \par Yuan Move A Plus For Brazil, But Little Immediate Impact \par OECD: China's Yuan Move To Support Rapid Growth \par Singapore MAS: Yuan Revualation Won't Have Major Impact \par Thai Ctrl Banker: Yuan Change Good For China, World, Baht \par Taiwan \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 : No Change To \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Policy \par Bk Of Korea: To Act Strongly In \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  If Needed On CNY Move \par Philippine Ctrl Bk Expects Peso Gain On Yuan Revaluation \par China's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Move Seen Benefiting Argentina's Farmers \par  \par  \par Other Stories: \par  \par Full Text Of China \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Statement On Yuan Change \par RATINGS WATCH: China Upgrade Factored In Revaluation \par Malaysia Ctrl Bank Says Moving To Managed Float \par US Stks Outlook: China's Yuan Move Offers Opportunities \par US Cos Likely To Remain Indebted To China Despite Reval \par China's Float Of Yuan Could Increase Tech Part Costs \par WSJ: US Specialist On China Sees Good And Bad In Yuan Move \par BIS: Yuan Move A Welcome Step Towards \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Flexibility \par US Sen Graham: China Move Achieves Much Of What Was Sought \par US Sens Schumer,Graham Suspend Vote On China Tariff Bill \par US Sen: China \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Move A 'Good 1st Step...Baby Step' \par Sen Grassley: China \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Move 'By No Means End Of The Road' \par US Cos May Seen Higher Funding Costs On China Yuan Move \par Retailers Still Have Options After China's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Move \par China \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Float May Level M&A Playing Field In US \par  \par  \par  \par The Markets: \par  \par US Stocks Fall But EBay, Office Depot, Qualcomm Buck Trend \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 EBay, Office Depot and Qualcomm provided some luster to what was otherwise a down day for the stock market.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par Treasurys Endure Torrid Session After China Revalues \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 U.S. Treasurys suffered a torrid bout of selling after China finally enacted a long-awaited revaluation of its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , the yuan, and Federal Reserve Chairman Alan Greenspan completed his second day of bullish testimony on the economy before Congress.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par World \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 : Dollar Falls, Yen Spikes On Yuan Revaluation \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The yen and other Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  spiked against the dollar and the euro Thursday, as China surprised \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets by revaluing its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par  \par Other Market Stories: \par USD/SGD At 1.6578 Vs 1.6565 As MAS \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Intervenes\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  -Dealers \par =Australian Dollar Rallies After \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 China\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Moves On Yuan \par =FOCUS: Yuan Revaluation Seen Too Small To Impact Metals \par Canada Afternoon: C$ Higher After Chinese Revaluation \par Agency Debt Could Be Big Loser In China Revaluation \par US Mortgages: Spreads Wider After Chinese Revaluation \par US Swaps: Spreads Widen As Tsys Fall On China Revaluation \par US Agencies: Spreads Widen On Yuan Revaluation \par Yuan Revaluation Short Term Negative For Mortgage Bonds \par Latin American \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  To Strengthen As China Revalues \par Chinese Companies' ADRs Move Up On Yuan Revaluation \par China \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Revaluation To Boost HK, China-Related Shrs \par China Yuan Revaluation Likely To Help Chinese Stocks, Bonds \par Latin America Trade Flows To Improve On Yuan Revaluation \par India Rupee May Add To Gains After Yuan Revaluation \par Malaysia Econ, Markets May Gain From Unpegged Ringgit \par Stronger Yuan A Blow To Argentina's Weak Peso Policy \par Mexico's Peso Strengthens To 10.6175/Dlr On Yuan \par China's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Move Not Enough To Impact Mexico Trade \par Argentina Peso Flat As \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Counters Yuan News \par Argentina Stocks Slip; Market Shrugs At Yuan Revaluation \par  \par  \par Commentary: \par  \par =POINT OF VIEW: China's Yuan Move To Help Its M&A In U.S. \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 China's modest \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  revaluation might have an outsized impact on Chinese companies' ability to execute takeovers in the U.S. The move might weaken U.S. Congressional and other opposition enough to allow future Chinese company attempts to buy U.S. counterparts to attain a greater degree of economic normalcy.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par =\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FOREX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VIEW: China's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Reform Begins To Crawl \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Reform of China's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  system picked up speed Thursday - it's now moving at a crawl.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 That won't be fast enough a pace to satisfy the harshest U.S. critics of Chinese policy, but it will probably win the Chinese government more time in which to take bigger and stronger strides towards \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  flexibility.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par =BIG PICTURE: China's Yuan Move No Panacea For Deficit \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Chairman Mao is credited with saying the longest journey begins with the first step. On Thursday, the People's Bank of China took the first step on a very long journey when it announced an adjustment to the yuan's exchange rate value.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par =\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FOREX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VIEW: China Move Hits \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Market Where It Hurts \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 For many \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  speculators and investors, China's revaluation of the yuan added a painful punctuation to what has been a problematic time.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par Other Commentary: \par =GLOBAL YIELD: It's Small, But China Move Packs Punch \par =ECB Watch:China Yuan Move Makes ECB Rate Cut Less Likely \par =AWSJ: Yuan Revaluation Gives China Monetary Flexibility \par =AWSJ: China Yuan Move May Spur Pressure For More Change \par =\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Focus: Speculation On Yuan Will Increase Now \par =FOCUS: Yuan Move Has Limited Impact On Oil Markets \par =CHARTING AMERICAS: Dollar Continues Its Own Revaluation \par =\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FOREX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VIEW: Chinese Revaluation Short-Term Boost For C$ \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 22-07-05 0107GMT ]  \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020050722e17m0001d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
