ted with possible revaluation of the yuan.'  \par \par \uc2 Newspaper Web site:  {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.thestandard.com.hk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.thestandard.com.hk }}}\uc2  -By Alastair McIndoe, Dow Jones Newswires; 852-2832-2340; djnews.hongkong@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -0-  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJCFWE0020050516e15g00001\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
