\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 China \highlight\uc2  2004  \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention \highlight\uc2  put at over $121 bln.  \b0\par\par\uc2 510 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Januar 2005\par 10:39\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 SHANGHAI, Jan 5 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is estimated to have spent substantially more than 1 trillion yuan ($121 billion) to buy hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market in 2004 in order to keep the yuan inside its targeted range, analysts said.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has announced it spent 852.3 billion yuan to buy \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the first nine months of 2004 and analysts said the volume of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading in the fourth quarter suggested the full-year figure was well above 1 trillion.  \par \par \uc2 Turnover on the China \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign Exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  Trade System jumped 38 percent to $209.04 billion in 2004, the highest level since the market was established a decade ago, exchange figures showed.  \par \par \uc2 Strong trade surpluses and a heavy inflow of foreign investment have left the market flush with \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the past five years and market players said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was virtually the only buyer of surplus hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the market.  \par \par \uc2 "While investors around the world are looking to a possible yuan appreciation, China's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has become the sole major player selling the yuan every day," said a dealer.  \par \par \uc2 The market trades in U.S. dollars, the Japanese yen, the euro and Hong Kong dollars against the yuan.  \par \par \uc2 China is under increasing pressure from the United States to revalue the yuan, but analysts said Beijing seemed determined to keep the exchange rate steady for now.  \par \par \uc2 A Reuters poll of 10 economists in December showed China was not expected to widen the yuan's razor-thin trading band during the first half of 2005 as policy makers focus on keeping control of a rapidly growing economy.  \par \par \uc2 Seven of the 10 polled on their six-month outlook said the band of 8.2760 to 8.2800 per dollar would remain despite worries about inflation and calls to let the yuan appreciate from countries that say its current rate gives Chinese exports an unfair advantage.  \par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is more concerned with the country's overall macroeconomic health than the cost of offseting the impact of surging \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves," said Yi Xianrong, an economist at the Chinese Academy of Social Sciences.  \par \par \uc2 Reserves rose an average of about $11.5 billion per month in the first eight months of 2004, before the pace doubled in September and October. In October, reserves surged more than $25 billion to $540 billion, the world's second biggest after Japan.  \par \par \uc2 Huge \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves caused base money to bulge, forcing the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to drain a net 529.21 billion yuan from the banking system through its open market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 2004, state media have reported.  \par \par \uc2 The amount was almost double that of 2003, when the bank soaked up a net 282 billion yuan at a cost of 30 billion yuan in interest payments, analysts said.  \par \par \uc2 "As costs jump to help maintain the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, pressure for the yuan to revalue will become unbearable within a few years," said analyst Yang Yongguang at Guohai Securities. ($1 = 8.276 yuan).   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050105e11500akl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
